  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Search for Common Ground MENA programme - Search for Common Ground MENA programme NEW</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Search for Common Ground MENA-program</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Objective of contribution:

To strengthen women&apos;s and youth&apos;s meaningful, enduring participation in advancing inclusive peace and security in the Levant and Yemen</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Programmet syftar till att fr&#xe4;mja kvinnors och ungdomars meningsfulla och varaktiga deltagande och bidrag till fred och s&#xe4;kerhet i Levanten och Jemen</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The programme aims to strengthen women&apos;s and youth&#x2019;s meaningful, enduring participation in advancing inclusive peace and security in the Levant and Yemen</narrative>
  </description>
